{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":70311,"seasonNumber":5},"checkedAt":1793435649639,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":5,"episodeCount":12,"posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"3096102","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"平沙湖突然出现大量蜥颅巨妖尸体，平沙湖区域统卫离曼对此严阵以待，并决定独自前往调查。此时听到消息后的张小侯亦执意前往。离曼深入平沙湖后受不明因素影响实力大降，为神秘人所救。而在平沙湖遭妖兽围堵的张小侯也恰被神秘人所救，并认出神秘人即莫凡。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":19,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y4a085rIT4eK58bY9S5xrThH0sS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y4a085rIT4eK58bY9S5xrThH0sS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/5/episode/1"},{"id":"3098016","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"张小侯和离曼从莫凡口中得知，平沙湖生态失衡原因在于武壳巨蜥。三人打算利用地形优势，引诱武壳巨蜥和毒沼千蚣鹤蚌相争。妖兽之战杀死了武壳巨蜥，莫凡收获其精魄，平沙湖生态平衡得到解决。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":20,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wbXnzjQbM9tXGHG4BGOHv7c54ol.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbXnzjQbM9tXGHG4BGOHv7c54ol.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/5/episode/2"},{"id":"3107001","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"泥鳅坠吸收武壳巨蜥精魄后，莫凡克制住了恶魔化反噬。告别了斩空和张小侯的莫凡，在去找妹妹叶心夏的途中，发生一系列搞笑打脸事件，最后终于能带心夏去吃饭。然而吃饭时，城市中心突然惊现巨型妖兽。为了掩护妹妹撤退，莫凡留到了最后，并与巨兽进行了对视。事后听到周围人对妖兽的出现议论纷纷，莫凡决定打电话给唐月……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nTLNQicCQhYtyA6NBtVaVEP63ML.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nTLNQicCQhYtyA6NBtVaVEP63ML.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/5/episode/3"},{"id":"3122367","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"张小侯抵达西要塞，与天鹰灰相识并成为朋友。与此同时，莫凡也来到了宋城找唐月。带着对玄蛇的疑惑，莫凡跟随唐月来到玄蛇的栖息地，了解了图腾玄兽与人类共存的原因。此时，恰逢玄蛇十年一次的蜕皮期，然而人类守护阵营里龙蛇混杂，唐月便邀请莫凡一起，帮助玄蛇顺利度过蜕皮期。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mBbjXZ9MhsjNlP0sSU0lL5hnGFk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mBbjXZ9MhsjNlP0sSU0lL5hnGFk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/5/episode/4"},{"id":"3122368","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"此前玄蛇出现的事件，发酵出一系列对玄蛇不利的言论，魔法宫廷内部以祝蒙为首的反对派要求交出玄蛇。魔法宫廷内部的争论引起玄蛇守护一族的警惕，唐月与莫凡连夜带着玄蛇转移。魔法宫廷内部的反对派为此大发雷霆，并决定暗中派人追杀莫凡二人。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yu1o1m1dWMur5e4qkqXL0vN7pC2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yu1o1m1dWMur5e4qkqXL0vN7pC2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/5/episode/5"},{"id":"3122369","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":19,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gFe7ErcFMnKeNJ8IFiCXA5HLr9B.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gFe7ErcFMnKeNJ8IFiCXA5HLr9B.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/5/episode/6"},{"id":"3122370","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"